OL,3,GNEWSACrash causes long rush-hour delays
OL,4,Aon M60
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are facing long delays on the
OL,7,FM60 in Greater Manchester after a crash
OL,8,Fleft two lanes closed during rush hour.
OL,10,FNational Highways said two of three
OL,11,Flanes were shut on the anti-clockwise
OL,12,Fcarriageway between junction 11 at
OL,13,FBarton and junction 10 for the Trafford
OL,14,FCentre.
OL,16,FTraffic data service Inrix reported
OL,17,Fcongestion back to junction 18 at
OL,18,FSimister Island, with queues also
OL,19,Fstretching onto the M62 as far as
OL,20,Fjunction 11 at Birchwood, near
OL,21,FWarrington.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
